              "rawText": "EXAMPLE 32 Prove or disprove that⌈x+ y⌉= ⌈x⌉+⌈y⌉for all real numbers x and y.\nSolution: Although this statement may appear reasonable, it is false. A counterexample is sup-\nplied by x = 1\n2 and y = 1\n2 . With these values we ﬁnd that ⌈x+ y⌉= ⌈1\n2 + 1\n2⌉= ⌈1⌉= 1, but\n⌈x⌉+⌈y⌉= ⌈1\n2⌉+⌈1\n2⌉= 1+ 1 = 2. ◂",
              "text": "EXAMPLE 32 Prove or disprove that⌈x+ y⌉= ⌈x⌉+⌈y⌉for all real numbers x and y. Solution: Although this statement may appear reasonable, it is false. A counterexample is supplied by x = 1 2 and y = 1 2 . With these values we find that ⌈x+ y⌉= ⌈1 2 + 1 2⌉= ⌈1⌉= 1, but ⌈x⌉+⌈y⌉= ⌈1 2⌉+⌈1 2⌉= 1+ 1 = 2. ◂",
