              "rawText": "A sequence is a discrete structure used to represent an ordered list. For example, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8 is\na sequence with ﬁve terms and 1, 3, 9, 27, 81 ,… ,3\nn,… is an inﬁnite sequence.",
