              "rawText": "Deﬁnition 1 A sequence is a function from a subset of the set of integers (usually either the set{0, 1, 2,…}\nor the set{1, 2, 3,…})t oas e t S. We use the notationan to denote the image of the integern.",
              "text": "Definition 1 A sequence is a function from a subset of the set of integers (usually either the set{0, 1, 2,…} or the set{1, 2, 3,…})t oas e t S. We use the notationan to denote the image of the integern.",
