              "kind": "definition",
              "section": "2.4",
              "subsection": "2.4.3",
              "rawText": "Deﬁnition 5 The Fibonacci sequence, f0,f 1,f 2,… , is deﬁned by the initial conditions f0 = 0,f 1 = 1, and\nthe recurrence relation\nfn = fn−1+ fn−2\nfor n = 2, 3, 4,… .",
              "text": "Definition 5 The Fibonacci sequence, f0,f 1,f 2,… , is defined by the initial conditions f0 = 0,f 1 = 1, and the recurrence relation fn = fn−1+ fn−2 for n = 2, 3, 4,… .",
