              "rawText": "Deﬁnition 1 The setsA and B have the samecardinality if and only if there is a one-to-one correspondence\nfrom A to B. When A and B have the same cardinality, we write|A|= |B|.",
              "text": "Definition 1 The setsA and B have the samecardinality if and only if there is a one-to-one correspondence from A to B. When A and B have the same cardinality, we write|A|= |B|.",
