              "subsection": "2.5.2",
              "rawText": "We will now split inﬁnite sets into two groups, those with the same cardinality as the set of\nnatural numbers and those with a diﬀerent cardinality.",
              "text": "We will now split infinite sets into two groups, those with the same cardinality as the set of natural numbers and those with a different cardinality.",
