              "rawText": "THEOREM 2 SCHR ¨ODER-BERNSTEIN THEOREM If A and B are sets with |A|≤ |B|and |B|≤\n|A|, then|A|= |B|. In other words, if there are one-to-one functionsf from A to B and g from\nB to A, then there is a one-to-one correspondence between A and B.",
              "text": "THEOREM 2 SCHR ¨ODER-BERNSTEIN THEOREM If A and B are sets with |A|≤ |B|and |B|≤ |A|, then|A|= |B|. In other words, if there are one-to-one functionsf from A to B and g from B to A, then there is a one-to-one correspondence between A and B.",
