              "section": "2.5",
              "subsection": "2.5.3",
              "rawText": "Deﬁnition 4 We say that a function is computable if there is a computer program in some programming\nlanguage that ﬁnds the values of this function. If a function is not computable we say it is\nuncomputable.",
              "text": "Definition 4 We say that a function is computable if there is a computer program in some programming language that finds the values of this function. If a function is not computable we say it is uncomputable.",
