              "kind": "text",
              "section": "2.6",
              "subsection": "2.6.4",
              "rawText": "Hence,\nA[r] = A⊙A⊙A⊙⋯ ⊙A⏟⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏟⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏟.\nr times\n(This is well deﬁned because the Boolean product of matrices is associative.) We also deﬁne\nA\n[0] to be In.",
              "text": "Hence, A[r] = A⊙A⊙A⊙⋯ ⊙A⏟⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏟⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏞⏟. r times (This is well defined because the Boolean product of matrices is associative.) We also define A [0] to be In.",
