        "rawText": "Deﬁnition 2 Two sets areequal if and only if they have the same elements. Therefore, ifA and B are sets,\nthen A and B are equal if and only if∀x(x ∈A ↔ x ∈B). We writeA = B if A and B are equal\nsets.",
        "text": "Definition 2 Two sets areequal if and only if they have the same elements. Therefore, ifA and B are sets, then A and B are equal if and only if∀x(x ∈A ↔ x ∈B). We writeA = B if A and B are equal sets.",
