        "rawText": "Deﬁnition 3 Let f1 and f2 be functions from A to R. Then f1 + f2 and f1 f2 are also functions from A to R\ndeﬁned for all x ∈A by\n( f1 + f2)(x) = f1(x)+ f2(x),\n( f1f2)(x) = f1(x)f2(x).",
        "text": "Definition 3 Let f1 and f2 be functions from A to R. Then f1 + f2 and f1 f2 are also functions from A to R defined for all x ∈A by ( f1 + f2)(x) = f1(x)+ f2(x), ( f1f2)(x) = f1(x)f2(x).",
