        "rawText": "Deﬁnition 11 Let f be a function from the setA to the setB. The graph of the functionf is the set of ordered\npairs{(a, b)∣a ∈A and f (a) = b}.",
        "text": "Definition 11 Let f be a function from the setA to the setB. The graph of the functionf is the set of ordered pairs{(a, b)∣a ∈A and f (a) = b}.",
